# Local private configuration
Configuration/Local.private.xcconfig

# The Pikmin Bloom spot catalogue. Generated from a source collection that is
# not part of this repository and is not published with it, so a checkout
# builds without it and the spot features are simply absent. Regenerate with
# scripts/build-pikmin-spots.py, which needs that collection.
RoamControl/Resources/PikminSpots.json
